@startuml Data Flow Diagram
!theme plain
title System Data Flow
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

' External Entities
actor "Test Engineer" as user
entity "Camera/VRU System" as camera
entity "LabJack DAQ" as labjack

' Processes
rectangle "Frontend Application" as frontend #E3F2FD
rectangle "Backend API" as backend #E8F5E9
rectangle "LabJack Monitor\n(Dedicated Process)" as ljmonitor #FCE4EC
rectangle "Ground Truth\nMatching Engine" as gtengine #FFF3E0
rectangle "Report Generator" as reportgen #F3E5F5

' Data Stores
database "PostgreSQL/SQLite" as db
database "Redis Cache" as redis
folder "File Storage" as files

' Data Flows
user --> frontend : Test Configuration
frontend --> backend : REST API Requests\n(Sessions, Videos, Results)

camera --> labjack : GPIO Signal\n(VRU Detection)
labjack --> ljmonitor : Voltage Stream\n(200 Hz)
ljmonitor --> db : Detection Events\n(timestamp, voltage)
ljmonitor --> frontend : WebSocket Updates\n(Real-time)

frontend --> backend : Video Upload
backend --> files : Store Video Files
backend --> db : Video Metadata

frontend --> backend : Start Test Session
backend --> ljmonitor : start_monitoring()
backend --> frontend : Session Status

frontend --> backend : Video Lifecycle Events\n(START, END)
backend --> db : Lifecycle Timestamps

backend --> gtengine : Detection Events +\nGround Truth Data
gtengine --> gtengine : Correlation Algorithm\n(Hungarian/Many-to-One)
gtengine --> db : Match Results\n(TP, FP, FN, Latency)

backend --> reportgen : Session Results
reportgen --> files : HTML/PDF Reports
reportgen --> files : Failure Snapshots

db --> backend : Query Results
backend --> frontend : Results Data
frontend --> user : Display Results\n& Visualizations

redis --> backend : Cached Data
backend --> redis : Cache Updates

' Notes
note right of ljmonitor
    **Data Captured:**
    - Hardware timestamp
    - System timestamp
    - Voltage value
    - Channel ID
end note

note right of gtengine
    **Output Data:**
    - actual_latency_ms
    - is_false_positive
    - match_type (TP/FP/FN)
    - correlation_status
end note

note bottom of db
    **Key Tables:**
    - test_sessions
    - detection_events
    - ground_truth_objects
    - test_results
    - detection_comparisons
end note

@enduml
